="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5b655484-f1ff-47a5-8903-d63c145b68b1" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dd636b69-5f3a-462b-b0f8-0a43da8f264c" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d984accf-ad57-432e-bdda-08c0e23c07fc" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="960" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/499d32e5-63b9-48b2-851c-bf095642216a" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/702d9bf6-8edb-4833-95f4-5dc46725f45b" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1656e261-1284-4048-9170-6e37b4dae80d" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b9bc8b09-3760-4298-94c7-bcf6a91c4ef3" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/71b937b9-11c0-43ee-b8ee-86d990403aae" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/73f47697-5d37-4c8f-a2b8-6797c2b6dc49" /&gt;</description></item><item><title>롱반 진판델 캘리포니아</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/hobby/wine/wine5/</link><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/hobby/wine/wine5/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="롱반-진판델-캘리포니아"&gt;&#10; 롱반 진판델 캘리포니아&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%eb%a1%b1%eb%b0%98-%ec%a7%84%ed%8c%90%eb%8d%b8-%ec%ba%98%eb%a6%ac%ed%8f%ac%eb%8b%88%ec%95%84"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2026-11-08&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/78a82bc0-0f95-449e-b201-27d00ba65c6e" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;병이 예뻐서 사본 레드와인,,&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;맛은 잘 안알아보고 샀는데 가벼운 맛이었다. 풍미는 잘 모르겠고 알콜 맛이 많이 나서 한잔만 마시고 방치중이다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;레드와인 저렴한걸로 살거면 무거운 맛이라도 있어야 마실만하다&amp;hellip;는 교훈을 얻은 와인이었다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/18b22ac8-d8c3-45d7-ba18-bc7ed6ee93b5" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;와인은 별로였지만 애슐리에서 첨으로 칠리새우를 사왔는데 요게 넘넘 맛있었다 ㅎㅎㅋㅋ&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>따뜻한밥한끼</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/hobby/daily/daily34/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/hobby/daily/daily34/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="따뜻한밥한끼"&gt;&#10; 따뜻한밥한끼&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%eb%94%b0%eb%9c%bb%ed%95%9c%eb%b0%a5%ed%95%9c%eb%81%bc"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2026-11-05&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5aa0923c-ed50-4730-83ea-d54c356dcd22" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ae6da25a-0145-4e11-80d0-3479000d6de9" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c44057d1-f123-49bb-ba2a-c981ca9b6fba" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c1aa5272-b795-4e93-bcf3-a7431ca20c0b" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/aaf5c92b-116f-49ce-8a3f-1a1240edbb07" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6f41c1a4-1741-4bcf-98e5-cf877652fe88" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ee13b23e-84bd-470c-b915-3a6cc60c9939" /&gt;</description></item><item><title>VCF MAF 변환 작업 #1 도커 연결, 레퍼런스 세팅, 배치 실행</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/bioinformatics/omics/om1/</link><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/bioinformatics/omics/om1/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="vcf-maf-변환-작업-1-도커-연결-레퍼런스-세팅-배치-실행"&gt;&#10; VCF MAF 변환 작업 #1 도커 연결, 레퍼런스 세팅, 배치 실행&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#vcf-maf-%eb%b3%80%ed%99%98-%ec%9e%91%ec%97%85-1-%eb%8f%84%ec%bb%a4-%ec%97%b0%ea%b2%b0-%eb%a0%88%ed%8d%bc%eb%9f%b0%ec%8a%a4-%ec%84%b8%ed%8c%85-%eb%b0%b0%ec%b9%98-%ec%8b%a4%ed%96%89"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2026-11-04&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# 1. VEP cache 다운로드&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;cd C:&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;\U&lt;/span&gt;sers&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;\A&lt;/span&gt;dmin&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;\c&lt;/span&gt;ure-ngs&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;\r&lt;/span&gt;eferences&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;\v&lt;/span&gt;ep&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;curl.exe -L -C - -o homo_sapiens_vep_116_GRCh37.tar.gz https://ftp.ensembl.org/pub/grch37/release-116/variation/indexed_vep_cache/homo_sapiens_vep_116_GRCh37.tar.gz&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# 압축 풀기&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;tar -xzf homo_sapiens_vep_116_GRCh37.tar.gz&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;ls .&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;\h&lt;/span&gt;omo_sapiens&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# 2. hg19 FASTA 다운로드&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;cd C:&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;\U&lt;/span&gt;sers&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;\A&lt;/span&gt;dmin&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;\c&lt;/span&gt;ure-ngs&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;\r&lt;/span&gt;eferences&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;\g&lt;/span&gt;rch37&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;curl.exe -L -C - -o hg19.fa.gz https://hgdownload.soe.ucsc.edu/goldenPath/hg19/bigZips/hg19.fa.gz&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# 3. 도커 연결&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;$env:Path +&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;;C:\Program Files\Docker\Docker\resources\bin&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;$IMG &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;ghcr.io/ncdcbioinformatics/cure-ngs-harmonizer:0.2.5&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;cd C:&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;\U&lt;/span&gt;sers&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;\A&lt;/span&gt;dmin&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;\c&lt;/span&gt;ure-ngs&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# 4. FASTA 압축 해제 .fai 인덱스 생성&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;docker run --rm -v &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;C:\Users\Admin\cure-ngs\references:/references&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; --entrypoint gunzip $IMG -k /references/grch37/hg19.fa.gz&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;docker run --rm -v &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;C:\Users\Admin\cure-ngs\references:/references&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; --entrypoint samtools $IMG faidx /references/grch37/hg19.fa&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# .dict 생성&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;docker run --rm -v &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;C:\Users\Admin\cure-ngs\references:/references&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; --entrypoint java $IMG -jar /opt/picard/picard.jar CreateSequenceDictionary R&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;/references/grch37/hg19.fa O&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;/references/grch37/hg19.dict&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# 결과 확인&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;ls C:&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;\U&lt;/span&gt;sers&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;\A&lt;/span&gt;dmin&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;\c&lt;/span&gt;ure-ngs&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;\r&lt;/span&gt;eferences&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;\g&lt;/span&gt;rch37&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-plain" data-lang="plain"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; 디렉터리: C:\Users\Admin\cure-ngs\references\grch37&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Mode LastWriteTime Length Name &#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;---- ------------- ------ ---- &#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;-a---- 2026-09-29 오전 9:15 9515 hg19.dict &#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;-a---- 2026-09-23 오전 10:00 3199905909 hg19.fa &#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;-a---- 2026-09-29 오전 9:14 3539 hg19.fa.fai &#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;-a---- 2026-09-23 오전 10:00 948731419 hg19.fa.gz &#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;hg19.fa(3.2 GB), hg19.fa.fai, hg19.dict 3개 파일이 생성됨.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>VCF MAF 변환 작업 #2</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/bioinformatics/omics/om2/</link><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/bioinformatics/omics/om2/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="vcf-maf-변환-작업-2"&gt;&#10; VCF MAF 변환 작업 #2&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#vcf-maf-%eb%b3%80%ed%99%98-%ec%9e%91%ec%97%85-2"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2026-11-04&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;NCDC_batch_vcf2maf_V.1.3.3_github.sh 파일을 확인해본 결과이다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# 1. user config&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;CORES&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;SAMPLE_TAG_LENGTH&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;8&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# Tumor_Sample_Barcode length (e.g., 8 → &amp;#34;S002-033&amp;#34;)&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;INPUT_DIR&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;/path/VCF_ALL&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;OUT_MAF&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;/path/VCF_ALL_MAF&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;...&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;GRCH37_FASTAS&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=(&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;.../hg19.fa&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;.../Homo_sapiens_assembly19.fasta&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;.../102_GRCh37/Homo_sapiens.GRCh37.dna.toplevel.fa&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;VCF2MAF_EXTRA_OPTS_GRCH37&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;--species homo_sapiens --ncbi-build GRCh37&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;병렬 개수, 샘플 ID 길이, 입출력 폴더, vcf2maf/VEP 위치, GRCh37 FASTA 3종을 지정한다. 실패하면 다른 fasta를 사용해서 돌리는것이다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;경로에 102_GRCh37, 뒤쪽 106행에 ensembl-vep-release-102가 보이는데, 원래 작업 환경이 VEP 102였다는 뜻이다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# 2. 레퍼런스 자동 탐색&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;resolve_reference_paths()가 설정한 경로에 파일이 없으면 SEARCH_ROOTS 아래를 find로 뒤져서 hg19.fa, chain 파일, homo_sapiens 폴더 등을 찾는다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>데이터 준비 (01)</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/bioinformatics/research/rs23/</link><pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/bioinformatics/research/rs23/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="데이터-준비-01"&gt;&#10; 데이터 준비 (01)&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%eb%8d%b0%ec%9d%b4%ed%84%b0-%ec%a4%80%eb%b9%84-01"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2026-11-02&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="1-gdc-파일-목록과-코호트"&gt;&#10; 1. GDC 파일 목록과 코호트&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#1-gdc-%ed%8c%8c%ec%9d%bc-%eb%aa%a9%eb%a1%9d%ea%b3%bc-%ec%bd%94%ed%98%b8%ed%8a%b8"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;GDC API로 TCGA-LUAD·LUSC의 파일 목록(RNA, miRNA, 변이, RPPA, 450K 메틸화, 진단용 슬라이드)을 받아 환자별 보유 자료를 정리하고 코호트를 정했다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;원발 종양 자료가 있는 환자: LUAD 571, LUSC 504&#10;코호트 (DX 슬라이드 + RNA): LUAD 474, LUSC 476&#10;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;병리 이미지 분석과 오믹스 분석이 같은 환자에서 이뤄지도록 코호트를 DX 슬라이드와 RNA를 모두 가진 환자로 정하였다. RNA는 있으나 DX 슬라이드가 없는 환자(LUAD 43명, LUSC 25명)는 제외되었다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>연구 정리 (01)</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/bioinformatics/research/rs24/</link><pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/bioinformatics/research/rs24/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="연구-정리-01"&gt;&#10; 연구 정리 (01)&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%ec%97%b0%ea%b5%ac-%ec%a0%95%eb%a6%ac-01"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2026-11-02&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="1-gdc-파일-목록과-코호트"&gt;&#10; 1. GDC 파일 목록과 코호트&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#1-gdc-%ed%8c%8c%ec%9d%bc-%eb%aa%a9%eb%a1%9d%ea%b3%bc-%ec%bd%94%ed%98%b8%ed%8a%b8"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;입력 크기 파일 최초 출처&#10;GDC 파일 목록 조회 9,793행 (GDC API 응답) GDC API files 엔드포인트, TCGA-LUAD·LUSC&#10; 자료형: Gene Expression Quantification,&#10; miRNA Expression Quantification,&#10; Masked Somatic Mutation,&#10; Protein Expression Quantification,&#10; Methylation Beta Value, Slide Image&#10;&#10;출력 크기 파일 내용&#10;GDC 파일 목록 9,793행 × 13열 data\manifest\gdc_files.csv 파일 × 환자 × 표본 한 줄 (파일 ID, 이름, 크기,&#10; md5, 자료형, 플랫폼, 실험 방식, 워크플로,&#10; 조직형, 환자·표본 바코드, 표본 유형, 층)&#10;코호트 950명 data\manifest\cohort.csv DX 슬라이드와 원발 종양 RNA를 모두 가진 환자,&#10; 층별 보유 여부&#10;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;분석 대상을 처음부터 하나의 기준으로 정해야 이후 모든 단계의 환자가 일치한다. 특히 이 연구는 병리 이미지와 오믹스를 함께 다루므로, 두 자료를 모두 가진 환자를 코호트로 정할 필요가 있다. GDC API로 TCGA-LUAD·LUSC의 RNA, miRNA, 체세포 변이, RPPA, DNA 메틸화, 병리 슬라이드 파일 목록을 조회하였다(9,793행; 한 파일이 종양·정상 표본에 함께 걸리면 표본마다 한 행). 이 중 진단용 FFPE 슬라이드(DX)만 병리 이미지로 사용하고 동결 절편 슬라이드는 제외하였으며, 메틸화는 450K 플랫폼만 남겼다. 원발 종양 표본 기준으로 하나 이상의 자료를 가진 환자는 LUAD 571명, LUSC 504명이었다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>겨울은 배신감의계절</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/hobby/music/music2/</link><pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/hobby/music/music2/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="겨울은-배신감의계절"&gt;&#10; 겨울은 배신감의계절&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%ea%b2%a8%ec%9a%b8%ec%9d%80-%eb%b0%b0%ec%8b%a0%ea%b0%90%ec%9d%98%ea%b3%84%ec%a0%88"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2026-11-01&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1168" height="1502" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/91d4dc82-9e8b-498a-920d-e10f8345be23" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1178" height="971" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/25ae2f7c-158b-4d1f-be45-0522a41681e2" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1172" height="1026" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8a1092a0-bb42-42e9-a475-94a80f33e749" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1178" height="741" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9762a500-006d-4359-a79d-c2eb757219b6" /&gt;</description></item><item><title>시</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/hobby/book/book57/</link><pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/hobby/book/book57/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="시"&gt;&#10; 시&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%ec%8b%9c"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2026-11-01&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;위기가 닥쳤을 때 사람들은 진기한 것을 구경하러 가거나 &amp;ldquo;전부 나가서 영화를 봐야 해&amp;quot;라거나 &amp;ldquo;발레를 보면 나을거야&amp;quot;라고 말하지 않는다. 우리가 찾는 것은 항상 시다. 우리가 듣고 싶은 것은 우리 귀에 속삭이는 인간의 목소리인 것이다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;귀에 대고 속삭이는 시인의 음성이 위로가 될 수 있는 까닭은 삶의 가장 고통스럽고 섬뜩한 순간에도 위엄을 유지할 수 있다고 말해주기 때문이다. 시는 가장 추한 감정들을 인정하는 동시에, 그 사이에 질서를 부여해 고귀하게 만든다. 시는 표현력이 무척 풍부하면서도 구성과 형식이 엄격하고 극도로 정제된 언어를 사용한다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>지나고나면다색채일뿐</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/hobby/daily/daily33/</link><pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/hobby/daily/daily33/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="지나고나면다색채일뿐"&gt;&#10; 지나고나면다색채일뿐&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%ec%a7%80%eb%82%98%ea%b3%a0%eb%82%98%eb%a9%b4%eb%8b%a4%ec%83%89%ec%b1%84%ec%9d%bc%eb%bf%90"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2026-11-01&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/919849fd-a4cc-45c2-8f11-eeae621a4ef8" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="960" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b8b7bb52-dcd5-4f00-8350-243ec73dc60f" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1178" height="2099" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3cc94ac2-2f48-442c-94e6-848eb7b7ac60" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1178" height="2065" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4adadc19-5291-415b-b278-444bf43ada2d" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="794" height="1164" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fc599b97-f290-40e5-8707-7b8a882efdb9" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="960" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f3504a55-e3d9-4f12-b81c-e0f76ed2b1e7" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="960" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b9c48ce6-64c1-46b8-8317-0b420101ff9e" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bf81187b-d5a4-45f8-a5c0-376e6694a6df" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/90291aa0-5170-4ccd-b9df-83eaab955e0f" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9c82ddbf-e0f9-4e97-a3e0-db7f0e67c010" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1157d9b9-8339-4c99-99ec-b66a73a105a5" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1adae60e-9c4e-444c-b5ce-8db90557874c" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1262" height="1684" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f436da79-bc24-4dbc-ac50-8e9dfd648e42" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="2244" height="1664" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f574b6ec-f682-41e1-912d-a315bc8a69ae" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1178" height="1352" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/97882deb-40da-49d1-a0a6-d0f74d760041" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;인간은 아픔을 싫어하는데 왜 아픔을 승화시킨것들은 아름다울까? 왜마음을 울릴까?&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>트러플헌터 모스카토 다스티</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/hobby/wine/wine4/</link><pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/hobby/wine/wine4/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="트러플헌터-모스카토-다스티"&gt;&#10; 트러플헌터 모스카토 다스티&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%ed%8a%b8%eb%9f%ac%ed%94%8c%ed%97%8c%ed%84%b0-%eb%aa%a8%ec%8a%a4%ec%b9%b4%ed%86%a0-%eb%8b%a4%ec%8a%a4%ed%8b%b0"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2026-11-01&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1258" height="1682" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cf2b2d2f-b60e-41ab-b5b2-ae2445b5d34e" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;연어롤이랑 같이 먹으려고 구매한 스파클링와인 !!&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;달달한 와인은 다 거기서 거기 아닌가? 싶어서 안사먹었었는데 이날은 달달한게 끌려서 구매하였다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;그리고 맛은 생각보다 너무너무 맛있었다 ㅎㅎ 가볍고 음료수같은 단맛이 아니라 포도의 무겁고 들척지근한 단맛이 났는데 그 정도가 역하지 않고 너무 좋았다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;탄산은 강하지는 않아서 화이트~스파클링 그 중간같다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1162" height="784" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bba6f47d-bc23-4598-bbc0-4ec2a413752a" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1170" height="1342" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3a83c1ab-7df7-41bb-a301-cb876e0c0778" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;테이스팅 노트대로 산미는 그렇게 안났다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;다른 리뷰를 보니까 꿀의 단맛이라고도 하고 시트러스향이 난다고 했는데 뭔가 묵직한 단맛이라는점은 맞는것같고 담에 마실때 향도 다시 확인해봐야겠다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>폐암 데이터셋</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/bioinformatics/research/rs22/</link><pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/bioinformatics/research/rs22/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="폐암-데이터셋"&gt;&#10; 폐암 데이터셋&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%ed%8f%90%ec%95%94-%eb%8d%b0%ec%9d%b4%ed%84%b0%ec%85%8b"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2026-11-01&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;전체 {&amp;#39;LUAD&amp;#39;: 584, &amp;#39;LUSC&amp;#39;: 504} → 코호트(RNA) {&amp;#39;LUAD&amp;#39;: 517, &amp;#39;LUSC&amp;#39;: 501}&#10;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;TCGA-LUAD, LUSC에서 각각 584장, 504장을 다운로드하였다. 분석 코호트는 RNA가 존재하는 517+501명을 사용하였다. (다운로드 방식: GDC API)&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt; LUAD LUSC&#10;MAF 465 463&#10;Meth 414 347&#10;RNA 474 476&#10;RPPA 328 304&#10;miRNA 467 460&#10;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;GDC 포털에서 5가지 오믹스를 다운받았다. 데이터가 존재하는 대상자는 이와 같다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;LUAD: 환자 414 | 탐침 486,427 → cg·마스크·성염색체 442,243 → 결측 400,772 | 대체 0.53%&#10;LUSC: 환자 347 | 탐침 486,427 → cg·마스크·성염색체 442,243 → 결측 397,085 | 대체 0.77%&#10;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;메틸레이션 데이터는 QC를 해줬고&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>